ymmetry about the molecular axis</p>\n<p>Choose the most appropriate from the options given below:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"B, C, D only"},{"identifier":"B","content":"A, B, C only"},{"identifier":"C","content":"B and D only"},{"identifier":"D","content":"A and C only"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>* Molecular orbital should have maximum overlap</p>\n<p>* Symmetry about the molecular axis should be similar</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>परमाणु कक्षकों के रेखीय संयोजन द्वारा आण्विक कक्षकों का निर्माण तभी होता है जब संयोजन करने वाले परमाणु कक्षकों</p>\n<p>A. के पास समान उर्जा होती है</p>\n<p>B. का न्यूनतम अतिव्यापन होता है</p>\n<p>C. की आण्विक अक्ष पर समान सममिति होती है</p>\n<p>D. की आण्विक अक्ष पर भिन्न सममिति होती है</p>\n<p>नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से सही उत्तर चुनें:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"केवल B, C, D\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"केवल A, B, C\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"केवल B और D"},{"identifier":"D","content":"केवल A और C"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>* आण्विक कक्षक में अधिकतम अतिव्यापन होना चाहिए</p>\n<p>* आण्विक अक्ष के परितः सममिति समान होनी चाहिए</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"molecular-orbital-theory","type":"mcq","year":2024,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["multi_statements"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-31st-january-morning-shift","active":true},{"question_id":"jaoe38c1lse7jz29","chapter":"d-and-f-block-elements","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-31st-january-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 31st January Morning Shift","permalink":"pidentify-correct-statements-from-belowp-pa-the-chr-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-gfkkqjnppggrbv9f","question":{"en":{"compreh